    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 16 The Belfry is an attractive and contemporary two-bedroom ground floor apartment, ideally suited to those seeking comfortable and convenient urban living.\nExtending to approximately 66 sq. m., comprising an inviting living / kitchen / dining area, two spacious bedrooms, shower room and ensuite. The property offers well-proportioned and thoughtfully laid-out accommodation, with excellent natural light throughout. \n\n\nThe apartment benefits from a generous private terrace, providing an appealing outdoor space that is ideal for relaxing while remaining in the heart of the town.\nConveniently located just off Church Street, within easy walking distance of Cavan town centre. The property enjoys an excellent location close to an extensive range of local amenities and services, including a variety of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting and recreational facilities. \nViewing is highly recommended by the sole selling agent by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.65m x 3.52m\nLaminate flooring, access to balcony / terrace area.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.91m x 2.63m\nLaminte flooring, fitted maple kitchen, recessed lighting.\n\nShower Room - 2.66m x 2.00m\nTiled flooring, w.c, vanity unit, shower, hotpress, part tiled.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.38m x 2.64m\nLaminate flooring, built in wardrobe.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.66m x 2.75m\nLaminate flooring, door to terrace.\n\nWalk through wardrobe - 0.87m x 1.96m\nShelved.\n\nEn-suite - 1.95m x 1.66m\nTiled flooring, w.c, vanity unit, bath, part tiled.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superb location off Church Street.</li><li>Turn key presentation.</li><li>Air conditioning system.</li><li>Terrace with west facing aspect. </li><li>Economy 7 heating. </li><li>Alarmed. </li><li>Secured off street parking.</ul>"
      },
